| Path | Owner |
| --- | --- |
| `src/main/resources/<%= prompt.resource %>` | yours: the system prompt |
<%_ if (features.javaTools) { _%>
| `src/main/java/<%= project.basePackagePath %>/tool/` | yours: the logic of your Java tools |
<%_ } _%>
| `src/main/java/<%= project.basePackagePath %>/generated/` | gen-agent: overwritten on regeneration, do not edit |
| `pom.xml`, `application.yml` | shared: gen-agent will merge its changes with yours |
